### HexaOrders — solicitudes de demostración (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Pedido aprobado: 125.50 → riesgo 10, APPROVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "demo_http", "amount": 125.50, "currency": "USD"}

### 2. Pedido aprobado: 750.00 → riesgo 40, APPROVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "demo_http", "amount": 750.00, "currency": "USD"}

### 3. Pedido en revisión: 1500.00 → riesgo 75, REVIEW
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "demo_http", "amount": 1500.00, "currency": "USD"}

### 4. Últimos pedidos (máximo 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### 5. Estadísticas de todos los pedidos persistidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/statistics

### 6. Validación: 3 decimales → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "demo_http", "amount": 10.001, "currency": "USD"}

### 7. Pedido inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. UUID mal formado → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/no-es-un-uuid
